e/image/asset/2138/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_IndieGogo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2138/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_IndieGogo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2138/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_IndieGogo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2138/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_IndieGogo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2138/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_IndieGogo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2138/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_IndieGogo.jpg","Slava Rubin, Founder of Indiegogo","Since its founding in 2008, Indiegogo has had explosive success as the world’s largest and fastest-growing crowdfunding platform, and we don’t see the momentum slowing down. In contrast to other crowdfunding vendors, Indiegogo is on a mission to “democratize funding” by providing an open platform and flexible funding model that allows anyone to participate. Still in its infancy, the crowdfunding industry is poised to become a massive sector, and we see this pioneering company leading the charge.","Our crowdfunding partner Indiegogo is democratizing funding by providing an open platform and flexible funding model that allows anyone to participate.","Indiegogo - IVP Portfolio - VC for Crowdfunding Fintech ","Indiegogo - IVP Portfolio ","The first and largest global crowdfunding platform",{"id":33,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"343","2014-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=8141&v=2","Dave Mandelbrot","/content/ivp-adds-crowdfunding-leader-indiegogo-to-its-portfolio/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/indiegogo/",{"id":41,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":42,"assetUrlXs":43,"assetUrlSm":44,"assetUrlMd":45,"assetUrlLg":46,"assetUrlXl":47,"assetUrlXxl":48},"345","https://asse